KG42.register("source_edge_archive-b39494121fe3ad15e227d92d",{"id":"20-storage_sharing_auction::v141-c-R004::E::v141-c-R004-E001","paper":"20-storage_sharing_auction","rule_id":"v141-c-R004","rule_ref":"20-storage_sharing_auction::v141-c-R004","record":{"edge_id":"v141-c-R004-E001","source":"coordination.local_operator","target":"matching.counterparties","type":"links","constraint_ids":["v141-c-R004-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E01","v141-b-g02-E05"]},"evidence_class":"S","provenance_gate":"direct_C_edge_with_constraint_and_source_excerpt","scientific_acceptance":false,"accepted_constraint_ids":["v141-c-R004-C001"],"held_constraint_ids":[],"semantic_review_status":"supported","source":"KG40-404d7eddbf0fc37c","target":"COMP-72f84a438787fbd5","source_occurrence_id":"20-storage_sharing_auction::v141-c-R004::V::coordination.local_operator","target_occurrence_id":"20-storage_sharing_auction::v141-c-R004::V::matching.counterparties","source_unit_id":"20-storage_sharing_auction::v141-a-M01::coordination.local_operator","target_unit_id":"20-storage_sharing_auction::v141-a-M01::matching.counterparties","omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"matching","context_text":"Community joint energy-storage ownership auction; determination of preliminary participant cutoffs before marginal-participant exclusion. | Community joint energy-storage ownership auction; exclusion of parties beyond the intersection cutoffs. | Community joint energy-storage ownership auction; optional inclusion of marginal participants. | Community joint energy-storage ownership auction; participant-group restriction for a truthful auction.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E01","v141-b-g02-E05","v141-b-g02-E06","v141-b-g02-E07","v141-b-g02-E08"]},"active":true,"source_signature":"70fa231561df65f766802f8c21b9ab93a4505fafabb04ec747ecfda3fca875ca","relation_scope":"original_occurrence_pair_only","internal_to_parent":false,"source_science":{"mechanism_id":"v141-a-M01","source_definition":"The scheme permits third-party intermediation by an auctioneer or community representative; the auctioneer controls the auction between storage owners and customers according to predefined rules. Scope: Joint energy-storage sharing between RUs and SFCs in the smart community.","target_definition":"The auctioneer determines the preliminary participating SFC and RU groups through cutoff counts K and J obtained from the intersection of the aggregate supply and demand curves. Scope: Community joint energy-storage ownership auction; determination of preliminary participant cutoffs before marginal-participant exclusion. Condition: The supply–demand intersection cutoffs satisfy a_K ≥ r_J. RUs outside {1, 2, ..., J} and SFCs outside {1, 2, ..., K} are removed from the auction process. Scope: Community joint energy-storage ownership auction; exclusion of parties beyond the intersection cutoffs. Condition: After K and J are determined, a_m \u003c r_i for every SFC outside {1, 2, ..., K} and RU outside {1, 2, ..., J}. The joint storage-sharing group is restricted to K − 1 SFCs and J − 1 RUs, excluding the marginal SFC K and RU J. Scope: Community joint energy-storage ownership auction; participant-group restriction for a truthful auction. Condition: J and K have been determined and auction truthfulness is required. SFC K and RU J may also participate in the joint storage-sharing trading group. Scope: Community joint energy-storage ownership auction; optional inclusion of marginal participants. Condition: A truthful auction is not a necessity.","constraints":[{"constraint_id":"v141-c-R004-C001","kind":"mathematical","role":"core","statement":"The auctioneer determines the preliminary participating SFC and RU groups through cutoff counts K and J obtained from the intersection of the aggregate supply and demand curves. Scope: Community joint energy-storage ownership auction; determination of preliminary participant cutoffs before marginal-participant exclusion. Condition: The supply–demand intersection cutoffs satisfy a_K ≥ r_J.","expression":"a_K \\ge r_J","formalization_origin":"source","template_id":null,"members":["coordination.local_operator","matching.counterparties"],"variable_refs":["v141-c-R004-x-K","v141-c-R004-x-J"],"parameter_refs":["v141-c-R004-theta-a-m","v141-c-R004-theta-r-i"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E01","v141-b-g02-E05"]}],"evidence":[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g02-E01","location":{"location_id":"src-441686b1ee-p04-c2r3__v141-a-M01-participation","page":4,"printed_page":null,"section":"IV. Auction Based ES Ownership","anchor_text":"er- nality properties, as we will see later, which are desirable in he any mechanism that adopts auc","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-04.png","occurrence_role":"definition"},"source_text":"1) Owner: The RUs in set N, which own the ES devices, and expect to earn some economic benefits, e.g., through maximizing a utility function, by letting the SFCs to share some fraction of their ES spaces. 2) Customer: The SFCs in set M, which are in need of ESs in order to store some excess electricity at a particular time of the day. The SFCs offer the RUs a price with a view to jointly owning some fraction of their ES devices. 3) Auctioneer: A third party (e.g., estate or building manager), which controls the auction process between the owners and the customers according to some predefined rules."},{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g02-E05","location":{"location_id":"src-441686b1ee-p05-c1r4__v141-a-M01-bidding","page":5,"printed_page":null,"section":"IV-A. Determination Rule","anchor_text":"the quantity qm ∀m of ES that they require. wo iii) Once the auctioneer receives the ordered informa","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-05.png","occurrence_role":"definition"},"source_text":"iii) Once the auctioneer receives the ordered information from the RUs and the SFCs, it generates the aggregated supply (reservation price of the RUs versus the amount of ES the RUs are interested in sharing) and demand curves (reservation bids a_m verses the quantity of ES q_m needed) using (2) and (3) respectively. iv) The auctioneer determines the numbers of participating SFCs K and RUs J that satisfy a_K \\ge r_J from the intersection of the two curves using any standard numerical method [44]."}],"omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"matching","context_text":"Community joint energy-storage ownership auction; determination of preliminary participant cutoffs before marginal-participant exclusion. | Community joint energy-storage ownership auction; exclusion of parties beyond the intersection cutoffs. | Community joint energy-storage ownership auction; optional inclusion of marginal participants. | Community joint energy-storage ownership auction; participant-group restriction for a truthful auction.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E01","v141-b-g02-E05","v141-b-g02-E06","v141-b-g02-E07","v141-b-g02-E08"]},"source_record":{"edge_id":"v141-c-R004-E001","source":"coordination.local_operator","target":"matching.counterparties","type":"links","constraint_ids":["v141-c-R004-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E01","v141-b-g02-E05"]},"paper_scope_note":"Initial selection boundary, removal of marginal participants, Stackelberg price, and spatial response are kept separate; this is limited to component use in this auction protocol and does not prove a unique equilibrium or real-world operation."}});
